  "id": "conduction",
  "term": "conduction",
  "definition": "In this context, conduction means the transmission of nerve impulses along axons. It is commonly indexed by nerve conduction velocity, a measure of how quickly signals travel, which reflects properties such as myelination and may relate to differences in cognitive functioning.",
